          <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Techily Fly" class="h-10 md:h-12 w-auto" />
        </a>
        <p class="text-lg text-tf-graphite-40 max-w-md">
          Your own Virtual Tech Team, working for you, to make your organization more efficient.
