          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-tf-coral shrink-0 mt-1" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>
            <p class="text-tf-cloud max-w-sm">
              Techily Fly By AbdurRahman Ibn Ghufran,<br/>
